/T44n1840_p0127c01","n":"0127c","t":"四不成有體無體全分一分自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0128a01","n":"0128a","t":"為因故名相違因因得果名名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0128b01","n":"0128b","t":"為二門三者言許言中所陳前"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0128c01","n":"0128c","t":"相違所餘皆不定此所作性因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0129a01","n":"0129a","t":"無正因者故於似立不見其過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0129b01","n":"0129b","t":"用此牒前因能立所立法之自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0129c01","n":"0129c","t":"用西域又釋數論眼等唯為不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0130a01","n":"0130a","t":"因四身相圓滿五聰明辯捷六"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0130b01","n":"0130b","t":"實非以為因故此等類並名無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0130c01","n":"0130c","t":"答有性有法是實德業之能有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0131a01","n":"0131a","t":"彼立宗言有性非實有性言是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0131b01","n":"0131b","t":"論有法差別相違因者如即此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0131c01","n":"0131c","t":"義有緣之性謂即此因亦能成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0132a01","n":"0132a","t":"四大種是法差別彼意本成能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0132b01","n":"0132b","t":"六三合違有四四合違有一余"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0132c01","n":"0132c","t":"因立順因正破乃相違因雖不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0133a01","n":"0133a","t":"性既為有法自相作有性有緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0133b01","n":"0133b","t":"違必正令宗不定相違之因亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0133c01","n":"0133c","t":"有第五依增勝過但立此五故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0134a01","n":"0134a","t":"親成宗故有四過喻是助成故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0134b01","n":"0134b","t":"有法及法如俱不成豈無此過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0134c01","n":"0134c","t":"釋成初能立有後所立無此初"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0135a01","n":"0135a","t":"舉極微為喻此闕所依所依既"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0135b01","n":"0135b","t":"等性既懷猶預皆火有不決山"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0135c01","n":"0135c","t":"遮非表喻不似因亦不反成云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0136a01","n":"0136a","t":"必無常隨即相屬著是有合義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0136b01","n":"0136b","t":"釋釋中有二初舉正合後顯倒"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0136c01","n":"0136c","t":"淮所立有亦應言彼立極微有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0137a01","n":"0137a","t":"成有二初明二立有後約計釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0137b01","n":"0137b","t":"論倒離者述曰下解第五過文"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0137c01","n":"0137c","t":"影顯故理門論解二量已云如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0138a01","n":"0138a","t":"至教離現別有耶為如非量所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0138b01","n":"0138b","t":"若他反難云汝定心緣火既得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0138c01","n":"0138c","t":"故設定心中尋名緣火等亦是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0139a01","n":"0139a","t":"五十二解云證緣無識一緣無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0139b01","n":"0139b","t":"論師大有同異及數論師所立"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0139c01","n":"0139c","t":"論現現別轉故名現量述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0140a01","n":"0140a","t":"前即有疑云如聲勝論因皆三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0140b01","n":"0140b","t":"量比量之因亦名比量答理門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0140c01","n":"0140c","t":"量果自證分體不離用即智名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0141a01","n":"0141a","t":"域共呼陽炎為鹿愛以鹿熱渴"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0141b01","n":"0141b","t":"執為實有謂自識現得亦名似"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0141c01","n":"0141c","t":"分為四初二如前第三出能破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0142a01","n":"0142a","t":"作名亦如於果立彼因號故也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0142b01","n":"0142b","t":"名能破彼實無犯妄起言非以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0142c01","n":"0142c","t":"久壽二年十二月二十九日以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1840_p0143a01","n":"0143a","t":"法印大僧都訓算法印大僧都"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T44n1840-因明入正理論疏","source":"CBETA T44n1840 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":155,"unit":"T44 頁欄"}